 (text "REAL NET-LABEL CONNECTIVITY. SOURCE VIN_FUSED is externally cable-fused. AUX VIN_PROTECTED is protected through F302 58V MINI; 2A FUSE NOT A GUARANTEED 1A LIMIT. KEEP RTN25 FLOAT." (at 32 17 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "f1512578-cc72-4c26-bf70-000000001330"))
 (text "STOP GATES: Q301 202V SOA / HOT 2.4A; VS-R313-315 0.75J 350ms; 9V VS BOOT; F302 HOLDER FOOTPRINT; J301/J302 POWER; OV/UV/COPPER/ISO. EN DEFAULT: populate R319 only for STANDALONE; TripTracer uses external 3.3V conditioned RUN_CMD." (at 32 26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "f1512578-cc72-4c26-bf70-000000001331"))
 (text "Top: power FETs / controller; below: grouped discrete protection with explicit real nets. INPUT FUSED: J301.1, output VINPROTECTED via replaceable DC MINI J302.1, 5V after separate LMR38020 sheet J302.2." (at 32 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "f1512578-cc72-4c26-bf70-000000001332"))
